          "label": "Words of the “What we sent” sheet and the line under a reply (web, ContextReceipt.tsx + ChatView.tsx): section names, source chips, reasons for leaving out, the disclaimer, the missing-receipt word, the stable-prefix and ×10-guard lines, the buttons and their reasons; the kernel contract is loom.context_receipt/1 (actions context.receipt and context.modify)",
